  "summary": "ReportWizardGenerator is a class/library for generating customizable reports. It maps internal attribute/column names to user-friendly display titles, supporting both English and French (default and alternative locales). It validates input parameters, constructs report headers, sets localizations, and can handle output formats. The primary workflow involves instantiating the object, configuring mappings, setting headers and parameters, and calling generate to produce reports. It also returns status codes for success or error conditions.",
